// THE SHARED DUCKDB's connection (slice R, 2026-11-18; planoracle.SeedDuckDbMain): the pure/v1 goldens' H2 connection
// (core/src/test/resources/upstream-api/trades-h2.pure, trades::h2::Conn) replaced by this one, so the same requests
// run on the DuckDB file seeded from that model's seed. ${DUCKDB_PATH} is the path of the reader's copy of the file.

###Connection
RelationalDatabaseConnection trades::h2::Conn
{
    store: trades::h2::DB;
    type: DuckDB;
    specification: DuckDB
    {
        path: '${DUCKDB_PATH}';
    };
    auth: Test;
}
